{
    "name": "FAIRe mapper: propose a mapping",
    "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
    "format-version": "0.1",
    "annotation": "The first step from a lab's own sample table to a FAIRe workbook. Profiles the columns of the\nsample table, proposes a FAIRe term for each (a crosswalk for review), lists the mandatory FAIRe\nterms not yet covered and what only a person can decide (a sample name used twice, controls not\nmarked, columns of notes, times with no time zone), and finds the primer pairs a methods text\nnames, cites or gives as sequences. Review the crosswalk, then run \"FAIRe mapper: write and check a FAIRe workbook\".\n",
    "tags": [],
    "license": "MIT",
    "release": "0.2",
    "uuid": "5764cb7d-4f44-41c9-a2e7-142bdc937e44",
    "creator": [
